---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure | RoamDawn" description="RoamDawn affiliate disclosure and transparency statement.">
<main class="container max-w-3xl page">
<p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p><h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
<p>RoamDawn may use affiliate links in travel guides, recommendations and other content.</p>
<h2>How affiliate links work</h2><p>If you click an affiliate link and complete a qualifying purchase or booking with the third-party provider, RoamDawn may receive a commission. This does not increase the price you pay.</p>
<h2>Our editorial approach</h2><p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee a positive editorial opinion or a particular ranking. We aim to provide useful, accurate and practical travel information.</p>
<h2>Third-party tracking</h2><p>Affiliate networks or merchants may use cookies or similar technologies on their own websites to attribute referrals. Their privacy policies and terms apply after you leave RoamDawn.</p>
<h2>Questions</h2><p>If you have a question about an affiliate relationship, email <a href="mailto:contact@roamdawn.info">contact@roamdawn.info</a>.</p>
</main></BaseLayout>
<style>.page{padding:48px 0 72px;color:#26343d}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:#287c8b;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.page h1{margin:.65rem 0 1.2rem;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,6vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.1;color:#182b35}.page p{max-width:780px;color:#68747b;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8}.page h2{margin:36px 0 10px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:1.55rem;color:#21343d}.page a{color:#287c8b;font-weight:700}@media(max-width:640px){.page{padding:28px 0 55px}.page h1{font-size:2.35rem}.page h2{font-size:1.4rem}}</style>